37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: Oh no! Half the customer plants lose signal all afternoon, and our developers are stuck until the third quarter.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: The coordination group is empty, yet two people still write every log by hand. Vendor queries are handled by just two clerks.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"- **Daisuke**: The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room after those spring cancellations.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @Daisuke, that’s a relief! So we can build software, but we can’t buy hardware or licenses?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: @Daisuke, that clarifies the constraint. We must build within the software allowance, avoiding any capital expenditure.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Sakura, that confirms the technical risk. If the signal is gone, a mobile app is useless. We need a different approach.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: @Daisuke, that is a narrow path. I must see if our past successes fit within such tight financial boundaries.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"- **Daisuke**: @Servas, yes, it is tight. I hope the past shows us what actually survived those limits.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @Asuka, exactly! If the signal is gone, a mobile app is useless. We need a different approach.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the signal loss makes a mobile app impractical. We must focus on tools that work offline or address the record duplication directly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, agreed. But the staffing gap means even a simple tool needs someone to maintain it. Who absorbs that?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: @Asuka, a fair point. I will see if the past winners had dedicated owners, or if they simply faded into the background.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"- **Daisuke**: @Asuka, that is a valid concern. I will check if the software allowance covers ongoing maintenance, not just the initial build.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @Asuka, that’s the scary part! If no one owns it, it dies. I’m glad we’re checking the staffing now.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the duplication is the core issue. If we fix the source, the manual logging burden drops, regardless of who is left to maintain it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, fixing the source helps, but someone still has to run the tool. I need to know if the remaining staff can absorb that extra duty.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
